// Stage 6a — Drug NER via ExploreDrugNerRunner (loads DrugMentionAnnotator.xml).
// Prefer: mvn -pl ctakes-examples exec:exec -DrunExploreDrug
//          -Dexplore.input=... -Dexplore.output=...
